{"ID":"20240205153643-c84qipk","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153643-c84qipk","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153643-c84qipk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164236-wv1fglp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205171002-p4h0x1f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205171121-0pm7mux\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"百部（子多母苦）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902115540"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205164236-wv1fglp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205164236-wv1fglp","updated":"20240205171402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【產地】\t主產湖北、廣西、雲南、四川等地。\n【性狀】\t直立百部：呈紡錘形，上端較細長，皺縮彎曲，長512cm，直徑0.51cm。表面黃白色或淡棕黃色，有不規則深縱溝，間或有橫皺紋。質脆，易斷，斷面平坦，角質樣，淡黃棕色或黃白色，皮部較寬，中柱扁縮。氣微，味甘、苦。\n蔓生百部：兩端稍狹細，表面多不規則皺褶及橫皺紋。\n對葉百部：呈長紡錘形或長條形，長824cm，直徑0.82cm。表面淺黃棕色至灰棕色，具淺縱皺紋或不規則縱槽。質堅實，斷面黃白色至暗棕色，柱較大，髓部類白色。\n【性味】\t甘、苦，微溫。\n【功效】\t潤肺下氣止咳，殺蟲。用於新久咳嗽，肺癆咳嗽，百日咳；外用於頭蝨，體虱，蟯蟲病，陰部騷癢。\n【炙品】\t蜜百部：取百部段，用煉蜜 (百部段100斤用蜜12斤8兩) 加入適量開水烊化，拌勻，稍悶，俟蜜水吸收，置鍋內文火炒至微黃色不粘手為度，取出，放涼。蜜百部形同百部片，表面棕黃色或褐棕色、略帶焦斑，稍有黏性。味甜。長於潤肺止咳，用於陰虛勞嗽。"}]},{"ID":"20240205171121-0pm7mux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205171121-0pm7mux","updated":"20240205171121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240205171121-3dcgaqy.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205171002-p4h0x1f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205171002-p4h0x1f","updated":"20240205171002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 413px;","style":"width: 403px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"百部"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/百部-20240205164236-s1bf0t7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 403px;\" parent-style=\"width: 413px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718093320-85shxoq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718093320-85shxoq","updated":"20240718093320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 413px;","style":"width: 403px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"百部 (17)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/百部 17-20240718093320-2e6vp66.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 403px;\" parent-style=\"width: 413px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718090553-6ok8lwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718090553-6ok8lwg","updated":"20240718091305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 637px;","style":"width: 627px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"百部 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/百部 2-20240718090803-p6capa1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 627px;\" parent-style=\"width: 637px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718090918-g4dowpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718090918-g4dowpy","updated":"20240718090922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"直立百部"}]},{"ID":"20240718091259-2tpvedz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718091259-2tpvedz","updated":"20